              "value": "(move)\n\nRequirements: The damibwa is in or adjacent to water\n\nThe damibwa moves up to double its swim Speed, descending at least 10 feet, and then makes a jaws Strike. If it was undetected at the start of predatory dive, it remains undetected until after the attack."
